 "about_text": "Shoshana Wayne Gallery is a contemporary art gallery founded in 1986 by Shoshana Blank and Wayne Blank. It was long based at the Bergamot Station arts center in Santa Monica, where it operated from 1994 until 2018, before relocating to Los Angeles's West Adams neighborhood in 2022. The gallery represents a diverse group of contemporary artists working across media including sculpture, painting, textile, and photography. It is a member of the Art Dealers Association of America and has participated in international art fairs such as The Salon Art + Design and The Armory Show, reflecting its ongoing engagement with the broader contemporary art market.",
